  "description": "This library provides classes to generate Ids for the German energy market. It supports the generation of Marktlokation-Ids, Messlokation-Ids and ClusterRessource-Ids, Netzlokation-Ids, SteuerbareRessource-Id, Steuergruppe-Ids and TechnischeRessource-Ids. The generated Ids are compliant with the specifications of the German energy market and can be used for testing purposes or as placeholders in development.",
